TITLE 1D transport: Ca-Cl initial, Na-Cl inflow, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -diffusion_coefficient 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift cell a_Na
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, ACT("Na+")

END
